1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Within the Clover's fifth leaf, there lives a devil.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Asta, born unable to harness mana, was granted the power of anti-magic from his five-leaf grimoire,

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
giving him the ability to nullify spells.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Unfortunately, the members of Spade Kingdom's Dark Triad also possessed powers from the devils of the Underworld,

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
and used them to launch an invasion on the neighboring countries.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Gaining strength from his belief in himself and from the support of his friends,

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Asta continues to fight for the safety of this world.

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
In a fierce battle, Yami and Asta defeated Dante.

9
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Looks like we haven't lost after all.

10
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Then, Xenon appeared and took Yami away, along with Captain William Bonchance.

11
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Captain Yami, no!

12
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:07,000
That night, when Asta tried to sneak away from the Infirmary Tower to save Yami,

13
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,000
he met someone new.

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
It was Noct, Vice-Captain of the Black Bulls.

15
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
I can teach you how to use your devil power.

16
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,000
If you would like to learn, that is.

17
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Noct carried Asta to the emergency captain's meeting.

18
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Tell us, who are you?

19
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
This man is with the Black Bulls.

20
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
He's their Vice-Captain.

21
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
He'd been operating in the Spade Kingdom as a spy.

22
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,000
However, I was unaware that he was possessed.

23
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Meanwhile, in the Spade Kingdom, the ritual to bring about the advent of Kleefoth was underway.

24
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,000
At its completion, a path would be open to the underworld.

25
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:52,000
And Yami and Bonchance, who were being offered as sacrifices, would lose their lives in the process.

26
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:57,000
In three days, the first of seven gates to the underworld will open.

27
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Unless the Dark Triad is stopped before then.

28
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,000
In that case, we'd better reach out to Heart for assistance as well.

29
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,000
I've tried, but they haven't answered me all day.

30
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:12,000
For a moment, it seemed as though Vanica's magic had decimated the Heart Kingdom.

31
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:24,000
I don't believe it.

32
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,000
Get it on, get it on,始めよう!

33
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,000
難航不楽のリアリティ

34
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,000
立ち止まる時間はないさ

35
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Hold on, hold on!

36
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Yeah!

37
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,000
7,5,4,リバティ

38
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
真実性 飲み込め 常識 覚え

39
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,000
逆境の先にある朝

40
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Oh, yeah!

41
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
幻想に埋もらえた 人生の夢

42
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,000
Hands up!

43
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,000
Shout it! Shout it! Louder!

44
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Yes! Do it! Do it! Start it!

45
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,000
Never give up!

46
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,000
限界を超えて もうかすぐして

47
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Experience!

48
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,000
We cannot pay!

49
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,000
Let's go!

50
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,000
Believe in myself!

51
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:16,000
衝動的に突き進め Don't be afraid

52
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:20,000
誰よりも高く飛べ Take it to the sky

53
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,000
想像を超えた 世界をこの手に

54
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,000
The ground up!

55
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:26,000
想像せよいつはいどない 自分の道

56
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,000
Yes! It's a ground up!

57
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,000
Hey, yeah!

58
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Believe in myself!

59
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,000
Hey, yeah!

60
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Yeah!!

61
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Yeah!

62
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,000
The 홍alindor

63
00:03:49,000 --> 00:04:01,320
This is crazy.

64
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:08,100
The Eye of the Midnight Sun's leader, and the Elves from the Third Eye?

65
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,100
You guys...

66
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,660
Where are we?

67
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:38,000
This is Elysia, a secluded part of a strong magic region, deep within the Heart Kingdom.

68
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:42,000
The mana here is incredibly dense.

69
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Oh, so they're awake.

70
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:50,000
Who are those two?

71
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:55,000
These children are the descendants of Licht and the Clover Kingdom's Princess Tatia.

72
00:04:55,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Back then...

73
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
Lady Tatia...

74
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:15,000
Lady Tatia...

75
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,000
She's...

76
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Still alive.

77
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:26,000
Judging by this mana, one of the twins she was carrying must have survived as well.

78
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:37,000
As soon as I realized that, I sealed Lady Tatia's wounds. Then I rushed to the Prince's side.

79
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,000
After that...

80
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:50,000
I woke up in the form of a bird. Many years had gone by. I had no idea what had become of the Princess.

81
00:05:50,000 --> 00:06:05,000
But she made it. Despite everything, her life was saved. The children of an Elf and a Human.

82
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:22,000
Prince Lumiere. The lives you always hoped for. The new world you wished for. They're here.

83
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:43,000
The place that we're in is the new home of the Elves. When we found it, I felt as though I understood the reason we stayed behind in this era.

84
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:51,000
I hope I'm not overstepping, but why did you decide to rescue us?

85
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:57,000
We received a divine word. From Dryad, the guardian deity who protects Elysia.

86
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Guardian deity?

87
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:09,000
We were told to help you. We rushed to the Heart Kingdom as soon as we heard. But we were too late.

88
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,000
Thankfully...

89
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:26,000
All of you had somehow used your own powers to survive those massive explosions.

90
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:51,500
We had already gone.

91
00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:53,000
Let's move on.

92
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,000
Please start.

93
00:07:54,000 --> 00:08:13,320
Because of you, the citizens of the Hard Kingdom were saved.

94
00:08:15,940 --> 00:08:19,280
I'm amazed that you were able to persevere against foes like them.

95
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,260
You've clearly become much stronger of late.

96
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:27,740
Persevering isn't enough.

97
00:08:29,020 --> 00:08:35,580
After all of those months of training, I should have been able to defeat them and make sure the world was safe for good.

98
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:40,900
Now that they've got Laura Petschka, who knows what's going to happen to her?

99
00:08:42,020 --> 00:08:42,800
That's why.

100
00:08:45,140 --> 00:08:48,400
We all need to build our fighting skills! And quickly!

101
00:08:49,060 --> 00:08:51,780
The four of you are even better mages than we are, correct?

102
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:54,160
So tell me how you got that way right now!

103
00:08:55,020 --> 00:08:59,900
Look at you. Is that really the proper way to ask someone to help, Little Miss Royalty?

104
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:03,880
You're lost to these enemies after months of hard training.

105
00:09:04,220 --> 00:09:07,780
And you think if you grow a bit more, that you'll be able to win?

106
00:09:07,780 --> 00:09:13,800
Not exactly. I know it's not that easy.

107
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:19,760
But giving up would be even more impossible for me!

108
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,780
We'll try!

109
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:22,920
Right, everyone?

110
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,440
That's right!

111
00:09:25,740 --> 00:09:26,620
I see.

112
00:09:26,620 --> 00:09:30,020
You guys are still a pain, like you always were.

113
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:33,180
Then, we'll teach you an elven art.

114
00:09:33,980 --> 00:09:36,360
Ultimate magic. That should help you.

115
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,360
I can't stop worrying.

116
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:45,700
I sure hope Charmy and the others are okay.

117
00:09:56,700 --> 00:09:57,380
Gaja!

118
00:09:57,380 --> 00:10:05,480
All right. I think I'm up to speed.

119
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:11,180
We're attacking Spade in three days, in the early morning hours.

120
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,920
What will you do?

121
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:15,080
Our forces will fight with you.

122
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:17,560
All of the spirit guardians are safe.

123
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:22,500
On the honor of the heart kingdom, we will rescue our queen.

124
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:26,380
Lady Noelle and the others are preparing to re-enter the fray.

125
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:29,460
Whether they make it in time depends on them.

126
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:33,020
Understood. Thank you for reaching out to us.

127
00:10:45,700 --> 00:10:47,060
I will save you.

128
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,420
No matter what.

129
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:52,060
I refuse to let them take his life.

130
00:10:53,800 --> 00:10:55,220
Wait for me, Yami.

131
00:10:56,520 --> 00:11:01,260
Well, on the bright side, Charmy, the other magic knights, and spirit guardians are all safe.

132
00:11:01,820 --> 00:11:03,420
Sounds like they're training some more.

133
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:05,280
It's time for me to get back to it.

134
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:06,380
Vice-captain!

135
00:11:07,380 --> 00:11:08,440
Yeah, that's weird.

136
00:11:09,740 --> 00:11:11,020
Where did you go?

137
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:11,200
Where did you go?

138
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:37,320
In three days, we'll gather the most elite of the magic knights and initiate an attack against the Spade Kingdom.

139
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:40,820
I'm sorry.

140
00:11:41,820 --> 00:11:44,080
You're the vice-captain of the Black Bulls?

141
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:48,460
If that's true, then why have we never seen you before?

142
00:11:48,460 --> 00:11:52,120
Simply put, it's because I hate the Black Bulls.

143
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:57,260
I'm content as long as I can still be a magic knight.

144
00:11:58,180 --> 00:12:01,600
Being a vice-captain is convenient because I can do as I please.

145
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:10,740
I despise people who can't do things properly, and the Black Bulls are a squad with a reputation for creating more problems than they solve.

146
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:19,560
You may have done well in the battle six months ago, but that doesn't even begin to erase all your past failures.

147
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:23,700
The Witch with a drinking problem.

148
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:28,820
The Spatial Mage whose philandering interfered with countless missions.

149
00:12:29,820 --> 00:12:32,220
The ex-noble slash convict.

150
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:35,140
And as for the ones who aren't around at the moment,

151
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:43,600
you've got an evil-looking delinquent commoner, and another evil-looking delinquent commoner just like him, except he wears a mask.

152
00:12:45,220 --> 00:12:48,940
The point is that your good-for-nothing captain built a team of losers.

153
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:54,060
But all of them are wonderful people!

154
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:56,820
You shouldn't judge them because of the way they look!

155
00:12:57,120 --> 00:13:01,600
If you don't want to be judged by your looks, then you need to change the way you present yourself.

156
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:10,580
Sometimes, those who seem evil or have a history of evil deeds will do something good, making them more likable.

157
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:14,800
But that is disgusting to me.

158
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:20,520
I vastly prefer people who are good from the start.

159
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:24,720
And that doesn't apply to any of you.

160
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:33,120
If you still want to save that worthless man's life, you have two days to improve your skills.

161
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:49,400
I've been meaning to ask, what's your magic?

162
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:51,260
Shadow magic.

163
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:55,540
It moves my body and anything I touch from one shadow to the next.

164
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:58,540
Awesome. So it's kind of like portals, then?

165
00:13:58,940 --> 00:13:59,800
Here we are.

166
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:03,020
A house?

167
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:11,160
Whose place is this?

168
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:14,180
It was a noble's house.

169
00:14:14,900 --> 00:14:16,580
Well, former noble.

170
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:18,680
Here.

171
00:14:20,140 --> 00:14:21,500
What's the deal, man?

172
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:22,620
What are we doing?

173
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:25,640
Shadow magic.

174
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:27,180
Dark garden invitation.

175
00:14:27,180 --> 00:14:43,180
Where the heck are we?

176
00:14:43,180 --> 00:14:59,340
For the next two days, I'll teach you everything I know about using the power of devils.

177
00:15:00,700 --> 00:15:03,580
And your capabilities are going to grow exponentially.

178
00:15:03,580 --> 00:15:06,480
So it's time to train, then?

179
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:07,780
Sweet, let's go!

180
00:15:08,740 --> 00:15:12,020
As it stands, you aren't using your devil's might to its full potential.

181
00:15:13,140 --> 00:15:16,580
Merely the scraps of excess power that happen to trickle down from it.

182
00:15:16,580 --> 00:15:22,620
This is unorthodox, but it does work.

183
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:29,360
To give you complete command, we'll perform a devil-binding ritual, a forbidden ceremony that requires you to make a formal deal with your devil.

184
00:15:30,500 --> 00:15:31,500
Devil-binding?

185
00:15:32,220 --> 00:15:35,220
Once we do that, its full power will become yours.

186
00:15:36,380 --> 00:15:38,220
First, we need a connection to the devil.

187
00:15:38,220 --> 00:15:42,680
Normally, you'd use a relic like what I have.

188
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:48,740
Something like this would temporarily allow you to summon the being from inside your body to our world.

189
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:51,200
But you seem to be a special case.

190
00:15:52,140 --> 00:15:58,500
Your arm, your grimoire, in fact, your very existence has a unique and profound connection to that devil.

191
00:15:59,560 --> 00:15:59,880
Right.

192
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:02,180
So, how am I supposed to do it?

193
00:16:02,180 --> 00:16:06,980
Summon.

194
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:12,400
What?

195
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:20,400
The devil.

196
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:23,040
My arm.

197
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:27,620
How about that?

198
00:16:27,780 --> 00:16:30,580
I wasn't expecting you to let me out on your own.

199
00:16:32,180 --> 00:16:35,940
Now it's time to fight him, and win.

200
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:39,860
Use your powers to bend him to your will.

201
00:16:40,580 --> 00:16:43,100
That's the only way to harness his full strength.

202
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:49,120
It's been a while since I got to stretch my legs.

203
00:16:50,420 --> 00:16:51,440
This is weird.

204
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:54,520
I can't believe he's standing right here in front of me.

205
00:16:54,520 --> 00:17:01,560
There's something I've wanted to tell you for a long time.

206
00:17:04,840 --> 00:17:05,820
Thanks a bunch!

207
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:11,640
That's right, you heard me.

208
00:17:12,060 --> 00:17:14,800
I can't even count how many times you've helped me in a fight.

209
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:30,400
Right here.

210
00:17:31,060 --> 00:17:32,260
Right now.

211
00:17:32,940 --> 00:17:35,440
I'm going to push past my limit!

212
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:50,380
Pass us right now.

213
00:17:52,580 --> 00:17:53,520
This is it.

214
00:17:53,740 --> 00:17:54,700
All I've got.

215
00:17:54,700 --> 00:18:02,840
I never would have been able to win all those crazy battles without your help.

216
00:18:03,300 --> 00:18:05,660
I seriously can't thank you enough for that.

217
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:08,480
Wow!

218
00:18:08,700 --> 00:18:10,920
So I take your right arm and you thank me?

219
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,420
Well, that was the bargain, wasn't it?

220
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:13,620
I can't really complain.

221
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:17,600
You're even more of a hopeless idiot than I thought you would be.

222
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:21,920
I guess it doesn't matter, though, because you're about to be a dead idiot.

223
00:18:23,460 --> 00:18:24,660
Not gonna happen!

224
00:18:25,620 --> 00:18:28,240
Anyway, I just remembered our first conversation.

225
00:18:29,740 --> 00:18:33,540
A half-out like you doesn't stand a chance in this fight.

226
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:36,200
You're just as short as I am, though!

227
00:18:36,820 --> 00:18:39,340
From the way you were talking, I thought you would be a giant.

228
00:18:39,420 --> 00:18:41,680
I'm not gonna get my butt kicked by the likes of you!

229
00:18:42,900 --> 00:18:47,540
You really have no idea what kind of mess you've gotten yourself into, do you?

230
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:55,560
Demon Slayer.

231
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:01,980
I told you, you'll never beat me!

232
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:05,120
Whoa!

233
00:19:05,860 --> 00:19:09,440
Now that you've let me into your world, I've got the advantage!

234
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:11,540
And I want more than your arm!

235
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:14,480
This time I'm going after every last bit of you!

236
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:16,520
He's up for a second!

237
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:18,220
I don't want to fight you, okay?

238
00:19:18,500 --> 00:19:19,500
I want to talk!

239
00:19:19,660 --> 00:19:20,460
You'll fight him.

240
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:24,840
Your intention is to make yourself stronger, isn't that right?

241
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:27,820
That means you'll have to face and defeat your devil.

242
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:28,840
Right now.

243
00:19:29,840 --> 00:19:33,660
If you lose, he'll take over and turn you into a vicious monster.

244
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:34,840
What?

245
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:39,800
The skulls you see on the altar belong to those who failed the devil-binding ritual.

246
00:19:40,220 --> 00:19:43,660
If you don't do this, I'll dispose of you and add you to their ranks.

247
00:19:46,500 --> 00:19:47,180
Hang on.

248
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:49,440
Isn't this forbidden magic?

249
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:52,080
This ritual thing.

250
00:19:52,660 --> 00:19:55,100
Is it something we're not supposed to be doing?

251
00:19:55,100 --> 00:19:57,240
We only have two days.

252
00:19:58,080 --> 00:20:00,940
Did you really think you could win playing by the rules?

253
00:20:03,180 --> 00:20:06,260
You wanted to grow your skill despite having no magic.

254
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:08,500
This is the world you stepped into.

255
00:20:08,500 --> 00:20:17,760
What are you doing?

256
00:20:18,120 --> 00:20:20,080
At this rate, you'll be killed for sure.

257
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:21,660
No.

258
00:20:22,360 --> 00:20:23,080
It's okay.

259
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:25,620
I know from his key he's not trying to kill me.

260
00:20:26,360 --> 00:20:27,200
I can tell.

261
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:30,820
Have you lost your mind?

262
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:32,860
You're dealing with a devil, remember?

263
00:20:33,560 --> 00:20:35,760
Creatures like him don't have principles.

264
00:20:37,080 --> 00:20:38,280
Got that right.

265
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:39,660
Trust me on this.

266
00:20:39,740 --> 00:20:42,660
Every devil you'll ever meet is a piece of shit like me.

267
00:20:43,140 --> 00:20:45,380
This guy's different from the one I fought back then.

268
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:49,040
I can't wait to take control of your whole body.

269
00:20:49,560 --> 00:20:50,700
Just because you're a devil,

270
00:20:50,700 --> 00:20:54,860
that doesn't automatically mean you're an evil being at heart.

271
00:20:57,200 --> 00:21:01,500
Damn it.

272
00:21:03,560 --> 00:21:05,040
I know the truth.

273
00:21:09,040 --> 00:21:10,840
You're not a bad guy.

274
00:21:10,840 --> 00:21:25,100
Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful.

275
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:31,380
夜明け前の空 静かにそっと

276
00:21:31,380 --> 00:21:38,680
ほら新たな日々が始まる

277
00:21:38,680 --> 00:21:43,300
胸にしまい込んだままの

278
00:21:43,300 --> 00:21:46,400
想いを解き放って

279
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:51,020
その翼を広げて

280
00:21:51,020 --> 00:21:53,280
No more time

281
00:21:53,280 --> 00:21:57,680
今飛び立て

282
00:21:57,680 --> 00:22:01,680
あの海原を見下ろして

283
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:05,180
誰よりも遠く

284
00:22:05,180 --> 00:22:07,140
何度でも

285
00:22:07,140 --> 00:22:09,360
We'll fly

286
00:22:09,360 --> 00:22:12,260
Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful

287
00:22:12,260 --> 00:22:15,700
どんな景色も

288
00:22:15,700 --> 00:22:19,500
君といれば輝くよ

289
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:23,700
だからずっとそばにいて

290
00:22:23,700 --> 00:22:26,640
And never let go

291
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:40,420
The world is so beautiful.

292
00:22:43,060 --> 00:22:44,500
Clover Police

293
00:22:44,500 --> 00:22:48,260
Vice Captain

294
00:22:48,260 --> 00:22:54,580
You know, it's a little bit weird that we don't have a Vice Captain.

295
00:22:54,580 --> 00:22:58,580
Yeah, but it kind of makes sense when you think about who our boss is.

296
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:01,080
Working for him is not for the faint of heart.

297
00:23:01,660 --> 00:23:05,080
If they wanted to drink with him, they'd have to be able to hold their liquor.

298
00:23:05,700 --> 00:23:09,860
And believe me, they'd need to be quick on their feet to handle all those crazy requests.

299
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:15,360
I think it would have to be someone with lots of strength and courage to stand by him in battle.

300
00:23:16,100 --> 00:23:20,380
And of course, his number two would have to wait around for him to take a number two.

301
00:23:21,500 --> 00:23:23,280
I guess that's why we don't have one.

302
00:23:24,580 --> 00:23:29,800
I hate that squad.

303
00:23:30,600 --> 00:23:31,320
I hate them.

304
00:23:35,580 --> 00:23:41,060
In this place where magic is everything, there lives one boy who was born without it.

305
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:46,080
Despite the many challenges he faces, he aims for the top and refuses to give up.

306
00:23:46,080 --> 00:23:49,340
Black Clover, page 170, the faraway future.

